{"code":0,"message":"ok","data":{"list":[{"id":"p_seed_017","createdAt":"2026-09-14T04:13:36.677Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-16T08:31:57.256Z","author":{"uid":"u_sports","name":"赛场内外","handle":"sports_side","verified":true,"bio":"赛事解读与运动员故事","color":"#0b4f9e"},"content":"五万人同时在看台上唱队歌是什么体验？收官战现场那种声浪，隔着屏幕都能起鸡皮疙瘩。青训体系能不能跟上，决定了这份热闹能持续多久。","images":["./img/news/31-finance-cover.jpg","./img/news/24-sports-cover.jpg"],"quote":{"id":"n_023j2s5","title":"职业联赛收官战吸引超过五万观众，青训体系建设成焦点","summary":"职业联赛收官战现场观众超过五万人，创下本赛季新高。赛后，多支球队公布了未来三年的梯队建设计划，青训投入占比将逐步提高。","cover":"./img/news/23-sports-cover.jpg","channel":"sports","channelName":"体育","source":"寰宇新闻网"},"topics":[],"repostOf":"","pinned":false,"status":"published","stats":{"likes":351,"reposts":1,"replies":1,"views":21436,"bookmarks":12},"score":41.9,"repostedBy":{"uid":"u_flash","name":"寰宇快讯","handle":"huanyu_flash"},"reposters":[{"uid":"u_flash","name":"寰宇快讯","handle":"huanyu_flash"}],"repostCount":1,"feedAt":"2026-09-14T04:25:36.677Z"},{"id":"p_seed_041","createdAt":"2026-09-13T09:31:36.677Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-16T08:31:57.233Z","author":{"uid":"u_life","name":"城市生活志","handle":"city_life","verified":true,"bio":"记录城市里的烟火气与人情味","color":"#0b4f9e"},"content":"跨城看演出带火了一座座小城。朋友上个月为了音乐节跑了趟外地，顺便玩了三天——现在的年轻人，演出是理由，出行是目的。#音乐节#","images":["./img/news/19-ent-cover.jpg"],"quote":{"id":"n_027e6c8","title":"音乐节与文旅深度融合：跨城观演带动目的地热度攀升","summary":"秋季音乐节密集开演，跨城观演成为主流，部分城市的酒店预订量在演出周末环比增长超过五成。","cover":"./img/news/19-ent-cover.jpg","channel":"ent","channelName":"娱乐","source":"寰宇新闻网"},"topics":["音乐节"],"repostOf":"","pinned":false,"status":"published","stats":{"likes":609,"reposts":0,"replies":2,"views":25266,"bookmarks":42},"score":41.2,"repostedBy":null,"reposters":[],"repostCount":0,"feedAt":"2026-09-13T09:31:36.677Z"},{"id":"p_seed_011","createdAt":"2026-09-13T16:31:36.677Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-16T08:31:57.262Z","author":{"uid":"u_flash","name":"寰宇快讯","handle":"huanyu_flash","verified":true,"bio":"寰宇新闻网官方账号 · 24 小时滚动播报","color":"#0b4f9e"},"content":"全国统一查询平台上线后，二手车最怕的「信息不对称」被削掉一大块。买二手车终于不用靠运气和人脉了。","images":["./img/news/34-finance-cover.jpg"],"quote":{"id":"n_03266iz","title":"二手车市场透明度提升：全国统一查询平台上线","summary":"全国统一的二手车信息查询平台上线，维保记录、出险记录与里程数据实现一键可查，交易双方的信息不对称明显改善。","cover":"./img/news/14-auto-cover.jpg","channel":"auto","channelName":"汽车","source":"寰宇新闻网"},"topics":[],"repostOf":"","pinned":false,"status":"published","stats":{"likes":661,"reposts":1,"replies":1,"views":18697,"bookmarks":38},"score":41.1,"repostedBy":{"uid":"u_car","name":"车评人老周","handle":"laozhou_car"},"reposters":[{"uid":"u_car","name":"车评人老周","handle":"laozhou_car"}],"repostCount":1,"feedAt":"2026-09-13T16:43:36.677Z"},{"id":"p_seed_025","createdAt":"2026-09-13T20:37:36.677Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-16T08:31:57.250Z","author":{"uid":"u_book","name":"读库笔记","handle":"reading_notes","verified":false,"bio":"读书、看展、逛博物馆","color":"#0b4f9e"},"content":"非遗工坊开进商圈，油纸伞、扎染、木刻都能自己上手做。手作体验成为周末新选择，挺好——传统手艺需要的从来不是被保护，而是被使用。","images":["./img/news/a-n_mu1zjf3cf084me-cover.jpg"],"quote":{"id":"n_035jskd","title":"非遗工坊走进城市商圈：手作体验成周末新选择","summary":"越来越多非遗工坊开进城市商圈，扎染、木作、金工等手作体验课程成为周末热门选项，部分课程需提前两周预约。","cover":"./img/news/11-culture-cover.jpg","channel":"culture","channelName":"文化","source":"寰宇新闻网"},"topics":[],"repostOf":"","pinned":false,"status":"published","stats":{"likes":752,"reposts":0,"replies":1,"views":21516,"bookmarks":66},"score":41.1,"repostedBy":null,"reposters":[],"repostCount":0,"feedAt":"2026-09-13T20:37:36.677Z"},{"id":"p_seed_032","createdAt":"2026-09-13T14:19:36.677Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-16T08:31:57.241Z","author":{"uid":"u_data","name":"数据小站","handle":"data_station","verified":false,"bio":"用图表说话，拒绝感觉派","color":"#0b4f9e"},"content":"农产品从田间到餐桌只用 18 小时。这个数字背后是冷链、分拣、干线运输的整套配合。电商下乡真正的门槛，从来不是网速。","images":["./img/news/44-china-fig1.jpg"],"quote":{"id":"n_003cu63","title":"县域电商新样本：农产品从田间到餐桌只用 18 小时","summary":"清晨五点采摘的果蔬，晚上十一点就能出现在千里之外的城市餐桌。随着冷链前置仓向县域下沉，一批产地直发品牌在电商平台跑出加速度。","cover":"./img/news/43-china-cover.jpg","channel":"china","channelName":"国内","source":"寰宇新闻网"},"topics":[],"repostOf":"","pinned":false,"status":"published","stats":{"likes":628,"reposts":0,"replies":1,"views":26548,"bookmarks":47},"score":37.2,"repostedBy":null,"reposters":[],"repostCount":0,"feedAt":"2026-09-13T14:19:36.677Z"},{"id":"p_seed_007","createdAt":"2026-09-13T11:01:36.677Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-16T08:31:57.266Z","author":{"uid":"u_life","name":"城市生活志","handle":"city_life","verified":true,"bio":"记录城市里的烟火气与人情味","color":"#0b4f9e"},"content":"一个有点扎心的观察：小区里的智能快递柜越来越多，会跟你打招呼的快递员越来越少了。技术在进步，人情味别掉队。#城市观察#","images":[],"quote":null,"topics":["城市观察"],"repostOf":"","pinned":false,"status":"published","stats":{"likes":600,"reposts":0,"replies":2,"views":19336,"bookmarks":55},"score":36.9,"repostedBy":null,"reposters":[],"repostCount":0,"feedAt":"2026-09-13T11:01:36.677Z"},{"id":"p_seed_031","createdAt":"2026-09-13T23:49:36.677Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-16T08:31:57.242Z","author":{"uid":"u_life","name":"城市生活志","handle":"city_life","verified":true,"bio":"记录城市里的烟火气与人情味","color":"#0b4f9e"},"content":"24 小时书店、深夜食堂带动的客流增长了三成。夜晚的城市不该只有便利店和外卖，还有热汤和聊天声。#城市观察#","images":["./img/news/a-n_mu1zjfgcnov8vu-cover.jpg","./img/news/40-china-fig1.jpg"],"quote":{"id":"n_002noey","title":"城市夜间经济回暖：24 小时书店、深夜食堂带动客流增长三成","summary":"入秋以来，多个城市的夜间消费明显升温。第三方平台数据显示，晚间 8 点至次日 1 点的餐饮、娱乐、零售订单量同比增长 31%，24 小时营业的门店数量同比增加近两成。","cover":"./img/news/44-china-cover.jpg","channel":"china","channelName":"国内","source":"寰宇新闻网"},"topics":["城市观察"],"repostOf":"","pinned":false,"status":"published","stats":{"likes":422,"reposts":0,"replies":1,"views":16083,"bookmarks":31},"score":35.2,"repostedBy":null,"reposters":[],"repostCount":0,"feedAt":"2026-09-13T23:49:36.677Z"},{"id":"p_seed_028","createdAt":"2026-09-13T17:43:36.677Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-16T08:31:57.247Z","author":{"uid":"u_may","name":"街拍阿May","handle":"may_street","verified":false,"bio":"用照片记录城市的光","color":"#0b4f9e"},"content":"第一次进数据中心参观，最冲击的不是机器多，而是安静——安静得能听见自己的脚步。那种「庞大的东西安静地运转」的感觉很难描述。#纪录片#","images":["./img/news/04-video-cover.jpg